# 🧠 What is a Generative AI Model?

A **Generative AI model** is an AI model trained to generate new content based on patterns learned from training data.

```text
Training Data
     │
     ▼
 AI Model
     │
     ▼
Learned Patterns
     │
     ▼
Generate New Content
```

Different generative models can be designed for different types of content such as text, images, audio, and video.

